之字道子，滎陽開封人，魏將作大匠渾之玄孫也。祖襲，大司農，經為江乘令，因居縣境。父遵，尚書郎。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-033-zhengxianzhi:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-033-zhengxianzhi:p001:m0043"}],"interpretation_note":"本傳明父遵，官尚書郎。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-nanshi019-xieyu-descendants-76-259","person_id":"gcu_93j_y97_A","title":"御史中丞","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-nanshi019-xieyu-descendants-76-259:a","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003","start":259,"end":263,"surface":"御史中丞","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0263","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003","quote":"義熙五年，帝將伐慕容超，朝議皆謂不可，劉毅時鎮姑孰，固止帝，以爲「苻堅侵境，謝太傅猶不自行。宰相遠出，傾動根本」。景仁獨曰：「公建桓、文之烈，應天人之心，雖業高振古，而德刑未樹，宜推亡固存，廣振威略。平定之後，養銳息徒，然後觀兵洛汭，修復園寢，豈有縱敵貽患者哉。」帝從之。及北伐，大司馬琅邪王天子母弟，屬當儲副，帝深以根本爲憂，轉景仁大司馬左司馬，專總府任。又遷吏部尙書。時從兄混爲尙書左僕射，依制不得相監，帝啟依僕射王彪之、尙書王劭前例不解職。坐選吏部令史邢安泰爲都令史、平原太守，二官共除，安泰以令史職拜謁陵廟，爲御史中丞鄭鮮之所糾，白衣領職。十一年，爲左僕射。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0263"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本句所載官名，任期無確切年月。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"th-song052-xiejingren-m5-36","person_id":"gcu_93j_y97_A","title":"御史中丞","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-song052-xiejingren-m5-36:a","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p005:m0040","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null,"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p005","surface":"御史中丞","start":36,"end":40}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xiejingren-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p005","quote":"坐選吏部令史邢安泰為都令史、平原太守，二官共除，安泰以令史職拜謁陵廟，為御史中丞鄭鮮之所糾，白衣領職。八年，遷領軍將軍。十一年，轉右僕射，仍轉左僕射。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p005:m0040"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按本見證原職名及其所屬人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002","text":"宋武帝將受禪，有司議使侍中劉叡進璽，帝曰：「此選當須人望。」乃使澹攝。澹嘗侍帝宴，酣飲大言無所屈，鄭鮮之欲按之，帝以爲澹方外士，不宜規矩繩之；然意不說，不以任寄。後復侍飲，醉謂帝曰：「陛下用群臣，但須委屈順者乃見貴，汲黯之徒無用也。」帝大笑。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002:u0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"有司","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"議進璽者未具名。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002:m0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"劉叡","person_id":"vd5_8v5_l9a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"有司之議所擬進璽者，實際改由澹攝。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002:m0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"澹","person_id":"ph1_0cf_nxw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"受命攝行進璽。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002:m0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"澹","person_id":"ph1_0cf_nxw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"侍宴者。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002:m0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"鄭鮮之","person_id":"gcu_93j_y97_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"欲按澹者。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002:m0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"澹","person_id":"ph1_0cf_nxw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"被稱方外士。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002:u0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"群臣","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"泛指眾臣。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002:u0100","start":100,"end":104,"surface":"委屈順者","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"以行止泛指受重用者。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002:m0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"汲黯","person_id":"fmh_dmt_cql","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"澹引作敢直言者之例。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19:p002:u0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"之徒","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"類稱，非汲黯的特定門人。"}],"source_position":{"raw_start":3413,"raw_end":3534,"raw_character_offsets":[3413,3414,3415,3416,3417,3418,3419,3420,3421,3422,3423,3424,3425,3426,3427,3428,3429,3430,3431,3432,3433,3434,3435,3436,3437,3438,3439,3440,3441,3442,3443,3444,3445,3446,3447,3448,3449,3450,3451,3452,3453,3454,3455,3456,3457,3458,3459,3460,3461,3462,3463,3464,3465,3466,3467,3468,3469,3470,3471,3472,3473,3474,3475,3476,3477,3478,3479,3480,3481,3482,3483,3484,3485,3486,3487,3488,3489,3490,3491,3492,3493,3494,3495,3496,3497,3498,3499,3500,3501,3502,3503,3504,3505,3506,3507,3508,3509,3510,3511,3512,3513,3514,3515,3516,3517,3518,3519,3520,3521,3522,3523,3524,3525,3526,3527,3528,3529,3530,3531,3532,3533],"revision_id":1531762,"source_layer":"received_biography","projection_sha256":"3ca00e18b9b6c9d986b5a0b6d3997459a7d1ea867c2fbd89dc910912d9c354a2"},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-dan19","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-dan19-ws1531762"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003","text":"義熙五年，帝將伐慕容超，朝議皆謂不可，劉毅時鎮姑孰，固止帝，以爲「苻堅侵境，謝太傅猶不自行。宰相遠出，傾動根本」。景仁獨曰：「公建桓、文之烈，應天人之心，雖業高振古，而德刑未樹，宜推亡固存，廣振威略。平定之後，養銳息徒，然後觀兵洛汭，修復園寢，豈有縱敵貽患者哉。」帝從之。及北伐，大司馬琅邪王天子母弟，屬當儲副，帝深以根本爲憂，轉景仁大司馬左司馬，專總府任。又遷吏部尙書。時從兄混爲尙書左僕射，依制不得相監，帝啟依僕射王彪之、尙書王劭前例不解職。坐選吏部令史邢安泰爲都令史、平原太守，二官共除，安泰以令史職拜謁陵廟，爲御史中丞鄭鮮之所糾，白衣領職。十一年，爲左僕射。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":8,"end":11,"surface":"慕容超","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0008","person_id":"d86_d07_abd","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作慕容超。"},{"start":19,"end":21,"surface":"劉毅","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0019","person_id":"a59_2c3_a2e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作劉毅。"},{"start":33,"end":35,"surface":"苻堅","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0033","person_id":"1bd_b18_3c0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作苻堅。"},{"start":57,"end":59,"surface":"景仁","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0057","person_id":"684_eaa_511","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝裕。"},{"start":165,"end":167,"surface":"景仁","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0165","person_id":"684_eaa_511","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝裕。"},{"start":189,"end":190,"surface":"混","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0189","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_BAC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝混。"},{"start":209,"end":212,"surface":"王彪之","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0209","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作王彪之。"},{"start":215,"end":217,"surface":"王劭","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0215","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAE","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作王劭。"},{"start":229,"end":232,"surface":"邢安泰","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p003:m0229","person_id":"gms_99b_hrg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作邢安泰。"},{"start":247,"end":249,"surface":"安泰","id":"c-nan